---
import { CONTENT } from "../site";

const sc = CONTENT.safetyCertifications;
---

<section id="certificaciones" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[var(--color-asphalt-surface)] border-y border-[var(--color-asphalt-border)] relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-sm bg-[var(--color-paper)] border border-[var(--color-asphalt-border)] mb-4">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)]"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-widest text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase">
          {sc.badge}
        </span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black font-display uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-4 leading-tight">
        {sc.title}
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-300 font-sans">
        Compromiso estricto con la seguridad operativa, prevención de riesgos en obra vial y estándares internacionales de pavimentación.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Certification Badges Row (Authentic Logos) -->
    <div class="bg-[var(--color-paper)] border border-[var(--color-asphalt-border)] p-8 rounded-sm mb-12 shadow-lg">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-center text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">
        Membresías Industriales & Sellos de Calidad de Obra
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 items-center justify-items-center filter grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-300">
        {sc.certifications.map((item) => (
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-3">
            <img
              src={item.icon}
              alt={item.name}
              class="h-16 w-auto object-contain opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200"
              loading="lazy"
              width="120"
              height="64"
            />
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-stone-300 uppercase mt-3">
              {item.name}
            </span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Safety Pillars Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-[var(--color-paper)] border border-[var(--color-asphalt-border)] p-6 rounded-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-[var(--color-primary)]/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-primary)] mb-4 font-bold text-lg">
          01
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold font-display uppercase text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-2">
          Cero Accidentes de Trabajo
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-300 font-sans leading-relaxed">
          Programa permanente de inducción diaria en seguridad vial, vallados perimetrales reflectivos y uso estricto de EPP de alta visibilidad clase 3.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[var(--color-paper)] border border-[var(--color-asphalt-border)] p-6 rounded-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-[var(--color-primary)]/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-primary)] mb-4 font-bold text-lg">
          02
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold font-display uppercase text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-2">
          Control de Suelos & Densidad Nuclear
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-300 font-sans leading-relaxed">
          Ensayos in situ de valor soporte CBR, control de humedad y densidad por densímetro nuclear antes de autorizar el tendido de la carpeta asfáltica.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[var(--color-paper)] border border-[var(--color-asphalt-border)] p-6 rounded-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-[var(--color-primary)]/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-primary)] mb-4 font-bold text-lg">
          03
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold font-display uppercase text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-2">
          Responsabilidad Ambiental & RAP
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-300 font-sans leading-relaxed">
          Reciclado de pavimento asfáltico fresado (RAP) para sub-bases granulares ecológicas, reduciendo el impacto en canteras y la huella de carbono.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
